{%- comment -%}
  BBB Trust Seal.

  Rendered from two places, once each, and each call declares which slot it is:

    {% render 'kw-bbb-seal', placement: 'standing' %}   -> sections/kw-footer.liquid
    {% render 'kw-bbb-seal', placement: 'floating' %}   -> layout/theme.liquid

  Only the slot matching Theme settings > Kilowash trust badges > "Seal placement"
  prints anything, so the seal can never appear twice and switching placement is a
  dropdown change, not a code change. "Off" matches neither slot.

  IT RENDERS NOTHING UNTIL A REAL SEAL IS SUPPLIED. There is deliberately no
  placeholder and no fallback graphic: a trust seal that is not the business's own
  issued seal is a fabricated credential, and an empty footer is the correct output
  until someone with BBB account access pastes the real one in.

  Two ways to supply it, in priority order:

  1. "Seal embed code" — the code BBB's Trust Seal generator hands you. For BBB
     this is normally the CORRECT path, not a fallback: their Trademark Usage
     Guidelines expect their hosted seal, so it reflects live accreditation status
     and stops attesting the moment accreditation lapses. Printed raw and
     unescaped, which is what an embed needs and why the field is admin-only.
     It costs a third-party request; that is the price of the seal being real.
  2. "Seal image" + "BBB profile URL" — a locally hosted static seal. Faster, and
     the right choice for any badge whose issuer permits self-hosting. Do NOT
     re-host BBB's seal bitmap here just to save the request: it would look
     identical while no longer tracking accreditation, which is the whole point
     of the seal. Takes priority over the embed when both are set.

  The floating variant is pinned bottom-LEFT on purpose. kw-light-switch is fixed
  bottom-right at z-index 500 (assets/kw-theme.css); bottom-right would bury the
  smart-light demo behind the seal on every page. The seal sits at z-index 400 so
  it can never cover the light switch or a cart drawer either.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- liquid
  assign slot = placement | default: 'standing'
  assign chosen = settings.kw_bbb_placement | default: 'standing'
  assign seal = settings.kw_bbb_seal_image
  assign profile_url = settings.kw_bbb_profile_url | strip
  assign embed = settings.kw_bbb_seal_embed | strip

  assign alt_text = settings.kw_bbb_alt | strip
  if alt_text == blank
    assign biz = settings.kw_seo_business_name | default: shop.name
    assign alt_text = biz | append: ' — BBB Trust Seal'
  endif
-%}

{%- if chosen == slot -%}
  {%- if seal != blank -%}
    <div class="kw-bbb kw-bbb--{{ slot }}">
      {%- if profile_url != blank -%}
        <a
          class="kw-bbb__link"
          href="{{ profile_url }}"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener"
        >
      {%- endif -%}
      <img
        src="{{ seal | image_url: width: 320 }}"
        alt="{{ alt_text | escape }}"
        width="{{ seal.width }}"
        height="{{ seal.height }}"
        loading="lazy"
        decoding="async"
      >
      {%- if profile_url != blank -%}
        </a>
      {%- endif -%}
    </div>
  {%- elsif embed != blank -%}
    <div class="kw-bbb kw-bbb--{{ slot }} kw-bbb--embed">
      {{ settings.kw_bbb_seal_embed }}
    </div>
  {%- endif -%}

  {%- if seal != blank or embed != blank -%}
    <style>
      .kw-bbb__link {
        display: inline-block;
        line-height: 0;
      }

      .kw-bbb img {
        display: block;
        height: auto;
        max-width: 100%;
      }

      .kw-bbb--standing {
        margin-top: 1.4rem;
      }

      .kw-bbb--standing img {
        width: 148px;
      }

      /* BBB serves the embed seal at fixed pixel dimensions and its rating text
         is baked into the bitmap. Scaling it to the widths above makes that text
         fuzzy, so the embed variant always renders at native size. */
      .kw-bbb--embed img {
        width: auto;
        max-width: 100%;
      }

      .kw-bbb--floating {
        position: fixed;
        left: clamp(14px, 3vw, 28px);
        bottom: clamp(14px, 3vw, 28px);
        z-index: 400;
      }

      .kw-bbb--floating img {
        width: 116px;
      }

      @media (max-width: 700px) {
        .kw-bbb--floating img {
          width: 88px;
        }
      }

      @media (prefers-reduced-motion: no-preference) {
        .kw-bbb__link {
          transition: opacity 0.2s ease;
        }

        .kw-bbb__link:hover {
          opacity: 0.82;
        }
      }
    </style>
  {%- endif -%}
{%- endif -%}
